{"The context is populated with d.Log (the base logger) instead of the enriched log variable that includes 'name', 'kind', and 'method' values, causing downstream code using klog.FromContext(ctx) to miss structured fields": 0.981532096862793, "When d.Storage.Create fails, the code incorrectly calls d.recordLegacyDuration instead of d.recordStorageDuration, mislabeling the metric and attributing a storage failure to the legacy store": 0.9867160320281982, "The third argument to recordStorageDuration is name (the resource name string) instead of options.Kind, which is inconsistent with every other metric recording call in the file and will produce incorrect metric labels": 0.9797590970993042, "Inside the goroutine that calls d.Legacy.DeleteCollection, the metric is recorded with recordStorageDuration instead of recordLegacyDuration, misattributing the legacy operation's latency to the storage metric": 0.9964053630828857}